'''Cane''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2015 Christmas Knife Box|Christmas Knife Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading, as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade uses a red and white striped texture, resembling the appearance of a candy cane, hence the name. The guard is golden, and the handle is red with gold decor that has a green bow tied around it.

==Trivia== 
*It has a [[Cane Gun (2015)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Cane_Set_(2015) Cane Set (2015)].

